<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Apna Sahara - Register Page</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="apnasahara.png" href="apnasahara.png">
    <!-- Google Fonts & FontAwesome Icons -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background: #f0f4f9;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .page-container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1000px;
        }

        .d1-card {
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 28px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.14fr 1fr;
            min-height: 540px;
        }

        .d1-left {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0052cc, #00a3ff);
            position: relative;
            padding: 50px;
            color: white;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .d1-left-circles {
            position: absolute;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .d1-circle-1 {
            position: absolute;
            width: 320px;
            height: 320px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
            border-radius: 50%;
            bottom: -120px;
            right: -40px;
        }

        .d1-circle-2 {
            position: absolute;
            width: 180px;
            height: 180px;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #00c6ff, #0072ff);
            border-radius: 50%;
            bottom: 20px;
            left: 140px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        }

        .d1-left h2 {
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
        }

        .d1-left h4 {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            opacity: 0.9;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .d1-left p {
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            opacity: 0.8;
            max-width: 340px;
        }

        .d1-right {
            padding: 50px 60px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .d1-right h2 {
            font-size: 30px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1e293b;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .d1-right p.subtitle {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #64748b;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        .d1-input-group {
            position: relative;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .d1-input-group i {
            position: absolute;
            left: 16px;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .d1-input-group input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 15px 16px 15px 48px;
            background: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 14px;
            outline: none;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            color: #334155;
        }

        .d1-input-group input:focus {
            background: #fff;
            border-color: #0052cc;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(0, 82, 204, 0.1);
        }

        .d1-btn-primary {
            background: #0c4a6e;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 15px;
            width: 100%;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.2s;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .d1-btn-primary:hover {
            background: #0a3a57;
        }

        .d1-footer {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-top: 35px;
            color: #64748b;
        }

        .d1-footer a {
            color: #00a3ff;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .d1-card {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .d1-left {
                display: none;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div id="design1" class="page-container">
        <div class="d1-card">
            <div class="d1-left">
                <div class="d1-left-circles">
                    <div class="d1-circle-1"></div>
                    <div class="d1-circle-2"></div>
                </div>
                <h2>WELCOME</h2>
                <h4>Create Your Account</h4>
                <p>Join our community and start making a difference. Register today to donate, support trusted organizations, and help bring hope to those in need.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="d1-right">
                <h2>Register</h2>
                <p class="subtitle">Join the Community of Kindness</p>
                <form action="/register" method="POST">
                    <div class="d1-input-group">
                        <i class="fa-regular fa-user"></i>
                        <input type="text" placeholder="User Name" name="name" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="d1-input-group">
                        <i class="fa-regular fa-envelope"></i>
                        <input type="email" placeholder="User Email" name="email" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="d1-input-group">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-lock"></i>
                        <input type="password" id="d1-pass" placeholder="Password" name="password" required>
                    </div>

                    <button type="submit" class="d1-btn-primary">Sign up</button>
                </form>

                <div class="d1-footer">
                    Already have an account? <a href="/login">Login</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>